# seraph-wing - detachable side blade, 48x64, 1 frame; native = RIGHT wing, engine mirrors for the left
# points down; inner mount edge = left side (slot x=1..2, y 22..37) meets the shell's side clamp
# light top-left (mirrored copy is lit from top-right), K outline, violet feathers + steel housing
